      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARA'S ANCHOR (1) had the drop on the lead from the squeeze box before taking over turning, drawing clear to score (25.49) at Q Lakeside in a Grade 5 over 457m. Ideally placed to take this out. BAREFOOT JOHNNY (6) has been a little hard to follow, finishing out of the placings latest but was in winning form two back scoring in a Restricted WIN at this track. Well placed here and should do much better. CYCLONE MICK (7) doesn't win out of turn but recent form sound. Continues to race well, filling the minors at the last three starts, the latest when second (25.38) at Q Lakeside. Solid record at the distance winning four races. Expecting another good run. HELLO GEMINI (8) is worth consideration.",
